ades, to achieve bigger and better bonuses. Combine a multitude of possible items and find the best possible upgrade path!<br>Combining your upgrades always results in a better bonus. Combine multiple of the same, to decided the result type.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Range</li><li>Damage</li><li>Reload Time</li><li>Cost Reduction</li><li>Armor Damage</li><li>Shield Damage</li></ul>",
